  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan flood response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCA Pakistan will through this response support people affected by the floods in Punjab and Sindh with:
&#x2022; Emergency shelter and NFIs, such as kitchen sets, mosquito nets, bedding items and hygiene and dignity kits. 
&#x2022; Safe drinking water and emergency WASH services, including hygiene promotion activities.
&#x2022; GBV-response related to awareness raising and referrals to GBV services. 
&#x2022; Multi-purpose cash assistance to vulnerable households.

Target group/number of beneficiaries: NCA Pakistan will target households evacuated from the floods in hard affected districts of Punjab and Sindh. The response will target specifically vulnerable groups such as women-headed households, elderly, children and people living with disabilities. 
The response aims to reach 35,000 direct beneficiaries.
Implementing partners: The response will be implemented through NCA Pakistan&#x2019;s local 
partners:
&#x2022; SPO Strengthening Participatory Organisation (Punjab) 
&#x2022; RDF Research and Development Foundation (Sindh)
* PAK Mission Society (Punjab)</narrative>
  </description>
